### Local pipeline runs
artifacts/
data/probe_dataset/
# Activation caches. Individual patterns above miss the report .json files
# that sit alongside them, so a blind `git add -A` still stages hundreds of
# MB. Ignore the directories outright; they are reproducible from events.
data/acts_*/


/nb_results
nb_results*.zip
notebook_runs/
notebooks/.executed/

### Upstream PTS, cloned not vendored (see configs/ for the pinned commit)
/pts/

